# The practice recipe encodes x and y from data fields, so each card is pinned
# on both axes and physics only separates overlaps; the former pull of 120 is
# retired (dynamics grammar plan, G7, F28). The drift is the largest distance
# any card sits from its value on an encoded axis.
assert snap practice-view == relations
assert snap practice-motion == true
settle 240
assert snap practice-encoded-drift <= 0.01
capture practice_encoded_grid
wait
dom click [data-practice-command="scatter"]
settle 240
assert snap practice-layout == scatter.default
assert snap practice-encoded-drift <= 0.01
capture practice_encoded_scatter
wait
log practice encoded axes receipt complete
